b) Research expenses may not be used to pay for: publication costs
c) computer hardware including laptops, electronic notebooks, digital cameras, etc;
d) books and other permanent resources;
e) the preparation of camera-ready copy, copy-editing, proof-reading, indexing, nor any
other editorial task;
f) subventions for direct production costs (printing, binding, distribution, marketing
etc);
g) costs of publication in electronic media;
h) carbon offsetting;
i) open access fees

